sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Edge Device Agent (Bank A/B)
    participant API as Device Ingestion API
    participant RD as Redis (Nonce & Semaphore)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant S3 as Object Storage + CDN

    loop Every 300s (Phase Offset hash(serialNo)%300 + Jitter +-30s)
        D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/check-in {serialNo, model, currentVersion, activePartition} + HMAC-SHA256
        API->>RD: Verify timestamp (+-300s) & SET NX nonce (replay check)
        API->>RD: Buffer lastCheckInAt (batch flushed to DB every 30-60s)
        API->>DB: Reconcile in-flight task via currentVersion & query eligible PENDING task
        alt No task / Campaign PAUSED / Outside maintenanceWindow / Backoff / No slot
            API-->>D: 200 OK {action: NO_TASK, nextCheckInSeconds: 300}
        else Eligible PENDING task & slot acquired
            API->>RD: Acquire 1 slot from sem:campaign:{id}
            API->>DB: UPDATE device_tasks SET status = DOWNLOADING WHERE status = PENDING
            API-->>D: 200 OK {action: UPDATE, taskId, attempt, downloadUrl (TTL 15m), checksum}
        end
    end

    D->>S3: Direct GET downloadUrl (~50MB via CDN)
    D->>D: Verify SHA-256 checksum
    alt Network drop or checksum mismatch
        D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/tasks/{taskId}/result {attempt, stage: FAILED, errorCode}
        API->>RD: Release download slot
        API->>DB: If attemptCount < 3 -> PENDING (backoff 1m -> 5m -> 15m); else -> FAILED
    else Checksum valid
        D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/tasks/{taskId}/result {attempt, stage: DOWNLOADED}
        API->>RD: Release download slot immediately (Q6)
        API->>DB: UPDATE status = INSTALLING
        D->>D: Write image to inactive Bank B (Bank A untouched)
        D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/tasks/{taskId}/result {attempt, stage: VERIFYING}
        D->>D: Set boot_try = 1 & reboot into Bank B under Hardware Watchdog
        alt Boot OK & WAN self-test OK
            D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/tasks/{taskId}/result {attempt, stage: SUCCESS, reportedVersion}
            API->>DB: BEGIN; task = SUCCESS; devices.currentFirmwareId = toFirmwareId; INSERT histories; COMMIT
        else Boot-loop 3 times or self-test failure
            D->>D: Bootloader Watchdog reverts to Bank A (old firmware intact)
            D->>API: POST /api/device-agent/tasks/{taskId}/result {attempt, stage: ROLLED_BACK, errorCode: ERR_WATCHDOG_BOOT_TIMEOUT}
            API->>DB: UPDATE status = ROLLED_BACK (no auto-retry; counted in Wave FailureRate)
        end
    end
